<title>USA: BIG Entertainment names Marci Yunes CFO.</title>
<headline>BIG Entertainment names Marci Yunes CFO.</headline>
<dateline>BOCA RATON, Fla. 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>BIG Entertainment Inc said Monday it had named Marci Yunes, formerly chief financial officer for Farm Stores in Miami, as its new CFO.  </p>
<p>BIG Chairman and chief executive officer Mitchell Rubenstein said he has been acting CFO.</p>
</text>
